Jetpack Compose Material 3 design tokens
https://github.com/androidx/androidx
Copyright The Android Open Source Project
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Token values are read from
compose/material3/material3/src/commonMain/kotlin/androidx/compose/material3/tokens/
at commit df73c2438e78ba644a436dc402ede6ba2d472812 (pinned in
tokens/sources.json) and converted to W3C Design Tokens files in
tokens/dtcg/compose/. The expressive motion springs in tokens/css/sys.css come
from ExpressiveMotionTokens.kt. Generated files state their source commit and
the original copyright in their headers. tokens/versions/compose/values/ holds
value maps generated from these tokens, used by the components that follow
Compose (snackbar, tooltip, card, top app bar, loading indicator, bottom sheet).

